			"notes": "#  **NEW FULL RELEASE VERSION 1.7.0** #\n\n## **Added** ##\n- Wither Cannon `/orbital wither` → skulls rain from above for 30s \n- Totem Stasis `/orbital totem <x> <y> <z>` → vanilla looking totem, pops and teleports you\n- TNT block damage toggle for **Nuke** and **Stab** (players still take dmg)\n- Disable Orbitals in the Config\n## **Changed** ##\n- New config options for wither cannon (test it out)\n\n## **HOW** ##\nthe wither cannon works in 2 ways \nwhen used it will target the nearest player in 48 blocks radius from the block the crosshair was targeting it will never target the user who used the rod\nif the player is dead it will look for the next one or just finish the duration without targeting a player"
		},
